        "content": "def grams(text, n=2):\n    return {text[i : i + n] for i in range(len(text) - n + 1)}\n\n\na = grams(\"紅色圓形在左邊\")\nb = grams(\"紅色圓形在右邊\")\ncommon = a & b\nall_parts = a | b\nscore = len(common) / len(all_parts)\nprint(\"共有片段\", sorted(common))\nprint(\"共有數\", len(common), \"聯集數\", len(all_parts), \"相似度\", score)\n"
